sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Hist as Historical usage
    participant FE as Feature builder
    participant Mdl as Forecast model
    participant Pl as Planner
    participant Own as Service owner
    participant Proc as Procurement
    Hist->>FE: utilisation, growth, seasonality
    FE->>Mdl: features per service
    Mdl->>Pl: demand forecast with a confidence band
    Pl->>Pl: add headroom for failover and peak
    Pl->>Own: proposed footprint and cost
    alt owner accepts
        Pl->>Proc: reserve capacity ahead of the lead time
    else owner disputes the forecast
        Own->>FE: supply a known upcoming event
        FE->>Mdl: re-forecast with it included
    end
    Note over Pl: order early enough to cover hardware lead time
